==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Kirlia}}.
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Legendary Treasures|Kirlia|60}} from the {{TCG|Legendary Treasures}} expansion.
*'''Slap''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Gym Heroes|Sabrina's Mr. Mime|94}} from the {{TCG|Gym Heroes}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

